>>>>>>>>>>>> I wish 
>>>>>>>>>>>> it was UI) that makes it so that the sumti it's used on is 
>>>>>>>>>>>> treated as if 
>>>>>>>>>>>> it was ko, i.e. a third-person command. 
>>>>>>>>>>>>
